Fresh is a SvelteKit 2 and Svelte 5 application deployed to Cloudflare Workers. Do not use the former Astro, Vue, Tailwind, or Cloudflare Pages assumptions.

Read and follow these repository instructions before making changes:

- .agents/README.md
- .agents/development.md
- .agents/architecture.md
- .agents/design-system.md
- .agents/product-status.md

Keep source comments and user-facing application copy in English. Keep the `.agents/` documentation synchronized with material architecture, product, workflow, and design changes.
